  "question": {
    "text": "The equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> has :",
    "image": null
  },
